  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• <strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>About our brand and products:</span></strong><span> Everyday Finds is a multi-category online store offering electronics, clothing, skincare, and body care products. We curate quality everyday essentials with a tech-forward, bold aesthetic — making it easy for customers to find what they need across categories.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different: <span style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">We bring together a diverse range of everyday products under one roof, with a focus on quality, easy navigation, and a seamless shopping experience. Our brand is modern, bold, and built for discovery.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p class=\"_p_3ycjt_109\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Affiliates earn a commission on every sale made through their unique referral link. Share our products with your audience and get rewarded every time someone makes a purchase using your link or code.</span></p><p class=\"_p_3ycjt_109\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>How to promote us:</span></strong></p><ul class=\"_ul_3ycjt_146\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:28px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:4px 0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;\"><span>Share product links on social media (Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, etc.)</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span>Write reviews or create unboxing/demo content</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span>Feature us in newsletters or blog posts</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span>Use your unique discount code to drive conversions</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information: <span style=\"color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\"> We're growing fast and love partnering with creators and influencers who align with our brand. Whether you're in tech, fashion, beauty, or lifestyle — there's a place for you in our affiliate program.</span></p></div></div>",
